<view class="page-shell">
  <view class="light-card invite-hero">
    <view class="pill">微信分享邀请</view>
    <view class="top-title">{{familyName}}</view>
    <view class="top-subtitle">把这张邀请卡片分享给家人，对方用自己的微信打开后加入同一个家庭。</view>
    <view class="invite-mascot">
      <view class="invite-glow"></view>
      <view class="invite-cat">猫</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="light-card invite-code-card">
    <view class="section-eyebrow">邀请码</view>
    <view class="section-title">给家人的加入口令</view>
    <view class="invite-code">{{inviteCode}}</view>
    <view class="row-desc">{{expiresHint}} · 当前已有 {{memberCount}} 位成员</view>
    <view class="invite-tip">家人收到卡片后，可直接打开小程序确认加入；也可以手动输入邀请码进入家庭。</view>
    <button class="secondary-button sticky-button" bindtap="copyCode">复制邀请码</button>
    <button class="primary-button sticky-button" open-type="share">发送邀请卡片</button>
  </view>
</view>
